 "message": "Good news: Noah Fischer (E036, Sales Engineer, Sales) already has CRM access on his record, so I haven't filed anything new.\n\nTo avoid a lockout before his demo, he can check his own login ahead of time at reset.fernhollow.test using his registered phone. If he's locked out or can't use self-service (for example, a lost phone), he'll need to contact IT, who verify identity on a video call before resetting anything. Our helpdesk can't reset passwords or MFA over chat, and nobody can request a reset for another person.\n\nIf CRM still doesn't work for him after that, let me know and I can help with next steps.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
